      "side": 1,
      "message": "I ran a local benchmark using packed synthetic repositories with flat root trees. These are steady-state localhost timings: JVM and filesystem cache warm, with no sidebar/tree-data cache.\n\nFor a file page:\n```\n   Root entries    Sidebar off p50    Sidebar on p50    Added latency    Added response size\n  ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━  ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━  ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━  ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━  ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n             1k              94 ms             99 ms             5 ms                179 KiB\n  ──────────────  ─────────────────  ────────────────  ───────────────  ─────────────────────\n            10k              91 ms            132 ms            41 ms               1.67 MiB\n  ──────────────  ─────────────────  ────────────────  ───────────────  ─────────────────────\n           100k              90 ms            439 ms           348 ms               16.9 MiB\n```",
      "parentUuid": "b33ef9c8_e53bbc41",
